Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Sixth Episode\NThe Icicle Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Copperland...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon all the countries of the world\Nwill be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Gelo:\Nwhat will be the next country?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.42,0:02:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Silverland\Nis a splendid country!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have desperately wanted it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But they say there is\Nan unyielding Princess..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...called "Sapphire".
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.46,0:02:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,To begin with,\Ninvite the girl to Coolland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite her to Coolland?! And after\Ninviting her, what will we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,During her absence..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...I will make sure that someone\Ngets rid of the King and Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, in Silverland there is\Nan evil man named Duralumin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,who could be very useful to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke,\Nthere is absolutely no one here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange,\Nbut I'm sure he will come
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you already devised a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...to eliminate the King and Queen\Nsecretly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But will you then make me\NLord of Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.26,0:03:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen never lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, then let me\Ntake care of the King and the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:03:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can do it\Nso easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:04:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will use Mephisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As a reward,\NI will give him Sapphire's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.90,0:04:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it right for her to go alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, the one who\Ninvited her is no ordinary person:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Icicle of Coolland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems she is called that\Nbecause of her coldness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hi, Tink!\N- Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm going to Coolland!\N- Really? Can I come with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's very cold there, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter! Take me with you, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.86,0:04:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go there together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful! Thank you!\NThank you so much, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.74,0:05:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He left on his own before\Nwe tried to get rid of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we'll reach the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.26,0:05:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How vast it is...!\NThe Queen must be very greedy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not right to speak ill of her,\NTink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who are you? - Did you know that here\Nis the border of Coolland?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?\NI am Sapphire of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a carriage ready\Nto welcome you. I will call for it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire,\NI have come to welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you want to get into the carriage?\N- No, no, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go with Opal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me,\Nbut such a wretched horse...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...is not worthy of belonging\Nto a Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal is not wretched!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.98,0:06:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean you are not\Nsatisfied with the carriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A golden carriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear, you must behave\Nlike a Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.54,0:07:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, I will\Nget in. Are you pleased?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Opale,\Nbut you must leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink, come! Let's get in, come on!\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.50,0:07:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait! Not you!\N- Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him to get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This carriage is for you!\NThat child cannot get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He is coming with me!\NGet in, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a guest of the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Should I get out?\N- No, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.22,0:07:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- You go on ahead!\N- What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to go, go by yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That carriage has no horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What? It has no horses?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It is those who get inside\Nwho make it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, here in Coolland,\Ncan make a carriage go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.86,0:07:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...without horses,\Nif they aren't too stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you understand, Tink?\N- No, absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll try anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:07:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a warning whistle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This carriage is nice\Nwithout horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You move this\Nand it goes in every direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I'm scared! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, I really don't know\Nhow to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- The scenery is always gloomy, huh?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There are traces of battle here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This land fought\Nagainst Coolland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that many\Npeople died. I'm sure. I can feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look what a big city!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.18,0:08:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder\Nif anyone still lives there
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we will arrive at the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How big it is! There are buildings\Nvery large ones all around!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, watch out! Watch\Nout! Look ahead! Look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a moat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.18,0:09:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, lower the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.42,0:09:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a salute shot!\NWelcome, Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- How clumsy they are!\N- Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Queen of this country.\NIcicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the invitation.\NI am Sapphire of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have broken\Nyour beautiful carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter. There are\Nmany carriages in my land.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.22,0:10:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me where he\Nended up Tink, my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he is waiting\Nfor you at the exit of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! Where do you want to take me? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:11:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- I told you to let go of me!\N- There you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is this?\N- It's a train, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A train?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's the train that\Nwill take us all to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.74,0:11:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of my\Ncountry, Princess Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it is the most\Nbeautiful country in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, I think so.\N- It certainly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you want to be an\Nally of such a beautiful country?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Copperland and Yalland\Nhave fought against my country...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...and they suffered\Nmany losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want your\Ncountry to suffer too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:11:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You will understand it by\Nyourself, because you are smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.90,0:12:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the power Coolland has.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Those horrendous tanks\Ncrushed Copperland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That blaze of fire\Nburned Yalland!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You are asking me\Nto become your allies...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...before we are\Ncrushed as well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.18,0:12:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do not want to suffer, you had better\Nsurrender immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My answer is no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you serious, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I categorically reject\Nyour offer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you intend\Nto ruin Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you worried that your\Nprecious land will go to ruin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course the fate\Nof my land worries me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But we would rather go to ruin\Nthan surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Coolland is beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.06,0:13:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will tell my father\Nthat it is an unpleasant country!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well said, Sapphire,\Nbut remember well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...what happens\Nto those who oppose Coolland!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to Silverland!\NGo and tell Duralumin...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...to call Mephisto immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you seen my friend\Naround here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he went back\Nbefore you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What? He went back?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he got tired of it, but we can\Ncatch up to him right away, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How insolent that Sapphire is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gelo, have you prepared that plan?\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.82,0:14:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My little bird must have already\Narrived at Duralumin's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke, I have brought Mephisto
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.26,0:14:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He said that Tink isn't there\Nand I rushed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly! Now things\Nwill go according to plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.26,0:14:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...and you can take\NSapphire's heart as agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can take Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Sapphire doing now?\NI wonder if she's alright...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no need to worry. Surely\Nshe is sleeping soundly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what on earth that could be..!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.06,0:16:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try the impossible!\NYou will never beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't defeat me!\NOh, I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.82,0:16:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to try! And\Nnow, don't move anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I will bring here\NPrincess Sapphire as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.22,0:16:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And Sapphire will be left without a heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I really think\Nit doesn't work anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter, let's walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't come, but up there is\Nthe road that leads to the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! You can come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.82,0:17:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain! I'm tired of\Nalways taking orders from Gelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.34,0:17:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry, we're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a doll! Damn\Nit, I've been tricked!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:19:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything went well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can go to Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I won't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.70,0:19:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't open my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.62,0:19:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's completely\Ndark... I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.06,0:19:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I must go back to Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no one here!\NNo one who can tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.70,0:19:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...if this is the\Nroad to Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.02,0:20:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? You can't\Ncross the border without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.34,0:20:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The border? I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the guard I saw\Nyesterday! I am Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.90,0:20:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Princess of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.34,0:20:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?! There's\Nno way such a dirty Princess could exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.34,0:20:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you think? - I think so\Ntoo! It's better to kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to fight\Neven though you are blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me where Silverland is!\NShow me the way right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, I'll show you!\NI will guide you myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland must be close: I feel\Nthat the smell of the wind has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.94,0:21:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I will meet my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, now I can proceed\Non my own. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite being blind,\Nshe is truly very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.62,0:22:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!\NI am Sapphire! Can't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Sapphire! Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.74,0:22:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Those voices belong to\NDuralumin and Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.02,0:22:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?\NWhat's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.42,0:22:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn lunatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.22,0:22:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you address the Grand Duke\Nwithout calling him "Grand Duke"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the gatekeeper,\Naren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Sapphire! Don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.54,0:22:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you laughing at so much?!\N- Don't try to confuse us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.26,0:22:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire\Nhas already returned to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.42,0:22:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Let me see\Nmy father and my mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.38,0:22:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,so you'll know that I am Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- My father and my mother\Naren't here. - What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They left the castle to me\Nand they've gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.66,0:22:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...on a secret journey.\N- And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the real Sapphire\Nand you'd better leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.38,0:22:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- I remember your voice.\N- Then who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.86,0:23:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it now! You're that guy who\Nthrew me off the cliff
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,.using Tink's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.90,0:23:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait!\N- Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You've become a fake\NSapphire, right? Where is Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.10,0:23:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to tell you! I will only\Ntell you that they are on a distant island!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.74,0:23:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, throw that lunatic out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.78,0:23:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you! Give them back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.94,0:23:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my father and my\Nmother! Give them back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.58,0:23:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up, cowards! Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.58,0:23:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How clever she was,\NQueen Icicle...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.50,0:23:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...to have used a fake Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.58,0:24:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not give up..\NI will not give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.46,0:24:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I will succeed, one day,\Nin crushing this conspiracy!
